      "body": "I added two cross-interpreter free-threading races to the list (16) and (86), and attached another zip to the issue description with their writeups and reproduction scripts:\n- (16) Cross-interpreter syslog race: syslog.syslog() borrows a global without a cross-interpreter lock.\n- (86) Cross-interpreter XID registry race: the local XID registry relies on GIL acquisition for thread safety, which doesn't work in free-threaded builds.",
